        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Lab honesty (read once)\n- **This stack is 5G IoT telemetry** (MQTT \u2192 TimescaleDB \u2192 Grafana). It is **not** the NTN satellite lab and **not** the ATG/A2G aircraft lab.\n- **MEASURED:** MQTT message rate, device online/offline, sequence PDR/gaps, MQTT echo RTT, RFC 3550 jitter, DB ingest lag, temperature / humidity / battery, GPS lat/lon reported by the device.\n- **MODELED \u2014 not radio-measured:** UERANSIM has **no PHY**. SS-RSRP / RSRQ / SINR / CQI are computed from `config/radio_model.yaml` and written onto telemetry rows. They are **not** OTA or gNB measurements. Do **not** `AVG(rsrp_dbm)` \u2014 mean RSRP uses linear `rsrp_mw` then 10 log10.\n- Empty RF tiles mean KPI columns are still NULL (apply `config/migrations/002_kpi.sql` and restart the simulator). Filter is `IS NOT NULL`, not `radio_source = 'modeled'`.\n- Grafana **5s** refresh \u00b7 **liveNow** \u00b7 dark ops theme (same visual language as NTN/ATG labs).\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Read before presenting",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
